          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngosuku lwesikhombisa umntwana wafa. Izinceku zikaDavide zesaba ukumtshela ukuthi umntwana ufile, ngokuba zathi: “Bheka, umntwana esaphila sakhuluma naye, akalalelanga izwi lethu; pho, uzozihlupha kanjani, uma simtshela ukuthi umntwana ufile?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
