            "sid": "2SA 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa lapho uDavida ebona ukuthi izinceku zakhe ziyanyenyeza, uDavida wabona ukuthi umntwana ufile; uDavida wasesithi ezincekwini zakhe: Ufile umntwana yini? Bathi: “Ufile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
